    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Looking at the dancing shoes on the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "windowsill",
            "zh": "窗台"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", I recalled many memories with them. They have been with me for four years, a constant reminder of my journey."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What I remembered so vividly was my "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "one"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " time dancing on the big stage. I was so nervous "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " my hands were "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sweating",
            "ref": "v-sweat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I held my "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "costume",
            "ref": "v-costume"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " tightly, full of fear that I would forget my moves and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "screw up",
            "ref": "v-screw-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the show. But as soon as the music started, and I felt the familiar floor beneath my shoes, I began to relax. Wearing my dancing shoes, I felt light and free, as if I were dancing on clouds. My "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "confident"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and strength seemed to return to me with every step I took. The shoes were like a good friend, supporting me "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "silence"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I treat my dancing shoes as if they are a great "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "treasure",
            "ref": "v-treasure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " colour is a soft, flesh pink, like a beautiful dress ready for a party. There is a thin "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "strap",
            "zh": "带子"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " attached to each side, which I tie neatly, like a ribbon on a gift. These shoes provide perfect "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "protect"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " so that I won’t fall when I jump or turn. They are small but very "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "exquisite",
            "ref": "v-exquisite"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", shining under the stage lights like two lovely girls. They carry my deep love for dancing and hold all the precious memories of my practices and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "perform"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I truly enjoy the happiness and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "free"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that dancing brings me."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The dancing shoes will stay with me all the way through my dancing life. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " they are a little "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "worn out",
            "ref": "v-worn-out"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " now, and some "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "scratches",
            "ref": "v-scratch"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " mark their surface, I will always remember them and cherish our time together. They have taught me to dance more seriously and to always dance with my own "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "imagine"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and joy."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
